{
  "name": "a required reference broken in the base value makes the record invalid",
  "rule": "a base value (an add, or a variant's own patch) whose required ref doesn't resolve is invalid, its layers don't run and aren't refused; an optional ref in the base becomes null and the record stays ok (registry.md#records-are-structs, dependencies.md#when-a-reference-is-missing)",
